  Owner 2026-10-24: "Yes, it appears that a lot of alpha animal ports got
  classified as Star Wars. We should move all of those."
  Moved here (batch 4) from src/RimStarWars/SWBestiary/Defs/Livestock/PawnKindDefs/PawnKindDefs_Karrask.xml.
 LIVESTOCK_STARTER_TRIO_1 - karrask PawnKindDef. Structural shape off
     vanilla Alpaca's PawnKindDef (ParentName AnimalKindBase, RimSage
     get_def_details) since karrask is tameable farm stock, not a wolf-
     line predator like this mod's existing Abyss PawnKindDefs.
     Single Graphic_Single texture per lifeStage at increasing drawSize,
